  "details": "Many avatars already come with face tracking in the form of unified expressions.\n\nUnified expressions likely needs no introduction, however it is a standardisation of parameter values, face, eye and neck shape keys.\n\nUsing these parameters if available on an avatar will significantly increase the liveliness of  the avatar while being captured by selfie expression.\n\nThese values can be found at https://docs.vrcft.io/docs/tutorial-avatars/tutorial-avatars-extras/unified-blendshapes",
